body:
Hi {{client.firstName}},

Your four home page directions are ready:

{{links.demo}}

Have a look and see which one feels like your business. You are picking a direction, not a final design, and a mix of two is a fine answer.

Reply with your pick and we will send the agreement. If you would rather talk it through first, say so and we will find a time for a short call.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Good talking with you. Here is the agreement for {{client.business}}. It lays out the build, the monthly fee, and what happens at each stage.

**Sign here:** {{links.sign}}

Once it is signed and the deposit is in, we send two short questionnaires: one on your brand, one to drive the build.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Thank you for signing. Next are two questionnaires. They are one pass each, not a back-and-forth, and your answers save as you go.

- Brand and demo feedback: {{links.brand}}
- Site build: {{links.build}}

The first confirms the direction you picked and collects your logo and brand files. The second drives the build: pages, services, and what each one has to do.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Every page your site will have is laid out here:

{{previewLink}}

The text is placeholder and the image areas are outlined boxes on purpose: this round is about whether the site has every page you need and how each one is put together. Send your changes in one go and we will fold them in.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Attached is the search research for {{client.business}}. It shows what people type into Google when they need what you do, which of those searches Google answers with the same pages, and the page list we are building from that.

The short version is on the second page. The rest is the evidence, search by search, in case you want to see how we got there.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Your copy and photos are in:

{{previewLink}}

Read it through, send your changes in one go, and we launch.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

We are ready to launch. The balance is due now:

{{payLink}}

Once it clears the site goes live at your domain, and the monthly starts on launch day as the agreement describes.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

A quick nudge: the {{questionnaire.title}} is still open. Your answers save as you go, so it is fine to finish it in more than one sitting.

{{questionnaire.link}}

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

We are set for **{{meeting.title}}** on {{meeting.when}} ({{meeting.minutes}} minutes).

Join here: {{meeting.link}}

A calendar file is attached. Reply to this email if the time stops working.

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

**{{meeting.title}}** is on {{meeting.when}}, {{meeting.hours}} from now.

Join here: {{meeting.link}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

{{client.name}} declined the {{agreement.name}} agreement.

Reason given: {{agreement.declineReason}}

Open the client in the office to follow up.
